          </inputVars>
          <outputVars>
            <variable name="ValueOut">
              <type>
                <REAL />
              </type>
              <documentation>
                <xhtml xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">/ Consigne filtrée sortie</xhtml>
              </documentation>
            </variable>
          </outputVars>
          <localVars>
            <variable name="T">
              <type>
                <REAL />
              </type>
            </variable>
            <variable name="Alpha">
              <type>
                <REAL />
              </type>
            </variable>
          </localVars>
          <documentation>
            <xhtml xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   🔁 FB_Filter_PT1 — Filtre passe-bas premier ordre (PT1 numérique)
   ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
   📄 Extrait depuis le projet CODESYS (Device.export, JOYSTICK/)
   🎯 Filtre exponentiel discret : y[k] = α·x[k] + (1-α)·y[k-1]
      où α = CycleTimeS / (T + CycleTimeS), T = TimeConst en secondes.
   ⚠️ Si TimeConst = 0 ou CycleTimeS = 0, sortie = entrée (pass-through).
   ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   📄 Docs : DOC/AF/AF_Partie-08_Fonction_Joystick_v2.0.md</xhtml>
          </documentation>
        </interface>
        <body>
          <ST>
            <xhtml xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">

T := TIME_TO_REAL(TimeConst) / 1000.0; // ms → s

IF T &lt;= 0.0 OR CycleTimeS &lt;= 0.0 THEN
    ValueOut := ValueIn;
ELSE
    Alpha    := CycleTimeS / (T + CycleTimeS);
    ValueOut := Alpha * ValueIn + (1.0 - Alpha) * ValueOut;
END_IF;
</xhtml>
          </ST>
        </body>
